// nestedmod is a module inside this one's directory tree, so its packages are
// not part of this module and `makebb ./nestedmod/cmd/p9ufs` cannot reach them
// on its own. A workspace is what makes building commands from both at once
// possible, now that makebb requires Go modules and has no GOPATH mode to fall
// back on. The nested-modules case in ../all_test.go depends on this file.
//
// 1.18 is the first release with workspaces, and both members declare go 1.13,
// so nothing here needs a newer one. Keep it that low: this directive is a
// floor on every toolchain CI tests, and `go work init` would write whichever
// version happened to run it.
go 1.18

use (
	.
	./nestedmod
)
